@startuml
' OWNER-MVP-2026-11-04 review: Reference / reusable template. Illustrative contract/model/pattern, not a product release commitment.
title Template example — Failure classification and safe next action
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

start
:Preserve identity and bounded actual observations;
if (Invalid / denied / stale?) then (yes)
 :Safe refusal / conflict;
else (no)
 if (Confirmed completion?) then (yes)
  :Record exact subject-specific result;
 else (no)
  if (Authoritative no-effect evidence?) then (yes)
   :Consider repetition only under actual contract and current authority;
  else (partial / unknown)
   :Reconcile same attempt if supported;
   :Retain uncertainty and intervention route if unresolved;
  endif
 endif
endif
:Release safe resources; preserve protected references and outcome evidence;
stop

@enduml
